    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>28级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 254；''重伤'' 127</span><span>''先攻'' +24</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 42，''强韧'' 40，''反射'' 40，''意志'' 41</span><span>''侦查'' +21</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 15 毒素</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">泽希尔的审判</div>\n<div class=description>如果唯一邻接该蛇人毒咒潜行者的生物是其近战攻击的目标，则该蛇人毒咒潜行者投两次攻<br>击骰且采用两个结果中较高的一个。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}巨斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+33vs.AC<br>命中：3d12+17 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">蛇之舞（瞬移）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该蛇人毒咒潜行者瞬移 3 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+23，宗教+21，隐秘+27</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 19（+18）</span><span>''敏捷'' 27（+22）</span><span>''感知'' 24（+21）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 22（+20）</span><span>''智力'' 14（+16）</span><span>''魅力'' 15（+16）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，龙语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 巨斧</span></div></div>\n</div>",
